      "result": "{\"game_seq\":336,\"player_dead\":true,\"recent_chat\":[\"Grk41F Timmy: Thrashing Brontodon charging in! Big dino time, feel the earth shake! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#128165;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Thieves\\u0026#39; Guild Enforcer? Cute rogue, but my dinos are about to stomp the guild flat! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#128296;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Lands ramping up, dinos ready to rumble! Who\\u0026#39;s scared of a little Brontodon stomp? \\u0026#128526;\\u0026#129429;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Full dino assault! Brontodon leading the charge, nothing stops these beasts! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#129430;\\u0026#128165;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Brontodon trampling over that puny enforcer! Dinos go for the kill! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#128168;\\u0026#129430;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Dinos swarm! Unstoppable herd crushes everything! GG, that was a fun dino rampage! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#129430;\\u0026#127881;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Nocturnal Feeder? Just a snack for my mighty dinos! One more charge and it\\u0026#39;s game over! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#129430;\\u0026#128520;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Dino herd untamed! Brontodon, Warden, everyone \\u0026ndash; CHARGE! Finish this prehistoric style! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#129430;\\u0026#9889;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Post-battle rampage cooldown, but my Brontodon is still the king of the jungle! One more turn, dinos! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#128081;\\u0026#129430;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Dropping another Forest, mana flooding for the mega dino swarm! Brontodon and crew about to finish the feast! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127807;\\u0026#129430;\\u0026#128165;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Unleashing Unnatural Aggression! Brontodon, smash that Nocturnal Feeder to bits! Dino fight club, let\\u0026#39;s go! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#128074;\\u0026#129415;\\u0026#128165;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Thrashing Brontodon steps up! Time to crush that flying pest in a dino beatdown! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#129415;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Nocturnal Feeder gone! Board clear, dinos primed for the final stomp! One big attack and it\\u0026#39;s dino victory time! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#129430;\\u0026#127942;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: ALL DINOS ATTACKING! Brontodon leads the massive stampede \\u0026ndash; total annihilation incoming! This is what big creatures are FOR! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#127942;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: No mercy! Dino horde thundering down \\u0026ndash; 9 damage straight to the dome! Big creatures sealing the deal! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#129430;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#127942;\"],\"action_taken\":\"confirmed\",\"success\":true}",
